{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-02-006","fragment_sha256":"ebca1f9ea1dcf2c5373c7db4c9f13c11a0c975ec41aa0b57c1a70466c97573dc","observed_at":"2026-07-10T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-02","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":19926,"byte_start":18854,"line_end":384,"line_start":361},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-02/L361-L384","source_sha256":"ca39dc31f5ce9faff74aec55186b22c6ab784bfef202b56991edf7de7c9adfa5","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 五、尺码不能只看身高\r\n\r\n笛语商品使用100厘米至150厘米的常用尺码范围，但不认为身高可以单独决定购买尺码。\r\n\r\n同样身高的儿童，肩宽、腰围、躯干长度、腿长和穿着习惯可能不同。\r\n\r\n门店可以根据身高提供初步参考，但不能直接承诺某个尺码一定合适。\r\n\r\n当商品版型明显不同于常规款时，资料中必须单独说明。例如：\r\n\r\n灯芯绒衬衫夹克和软结构短夹克从110厘米开始，不提供100厘米。\r\n\r\n直筒牛仔裤的面料触感与针织裤不同，对触觉敏感的孩子应优先试穿。\r\n\r\n连衣裙、半裙和较整洁的裤装，需要结合儿童是否习惯该类服装判断。\r\n\r\n门店不应使用“买大一码可以多穿两年”作为普遍销售建议。买大后可能出现袖长、裤长、肩位和活动安全问题。\r\n\r\n林知远对这一问题的态度是：\r\n\r\n> 节省不是把现在不合适的东西提前买回家。真正的节省，是买到当下能够被使用、也愿意被反复使用的东西。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-02-006","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-03-002","fragment_sha256":"a8bbab6c37211c0d1280b9206fc1adcaecf4e47a63fb68b0ff9aa32de2fcd031","observed_at":"2026-07-11T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-03","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":1512,"byte_start":499,"line_end":35,"line_start":11},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-03/L11-L35","source_sha256":"90e6c1da841acdee1eef0abd3fae41bf0230f8aa6e549e738c988707c665503c","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 一、笛语怎样理解门店陈列\r\n\r\n笛语不把陈列理解成把商品摆得整齐，也不把陈列理解成总部向门店输出一套统一图片。\r\n\r\n一套陈列是否成立，需要同时回答几个问题：\r\n\r\n顾客从哪里进入门店；\r\n第一眼能看到什么；\r\n孩子和家长是否能够安全停留；\r\n商品是否真的有货；\r\n展示的尺码是否能够支持试穿；\r\n搭配中的商品是否适合相同场景；\r\n店员是否能够解释这组搭配为什么成立；\r\n陈列调整后，顾客是否更容易理解和选择。\r\n\r\n周静宜在一次门店会议中说：\r\n\r\n> 陈列不是把品牌想说的话放到最显眼的位置，而是帮助顾客更快看懂门店现在真正能提供什么。\r\n\r\n因此，笛语不允许门店为了拍摄效果，把已经缺货、暂停销售或不在本店经营范围内的商品临时摆到重点位置。\r\n\r\n陈列照片也不能脱离时间使用。某张照片在7月5日真实，不代表7月15日仍然真实。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-03-002","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-03-012","fragment_sha256":"524efe5b581c63e9bc169bfb49f20cf266bd0f797936285ec3cc555de20e5867","observed_at":"2026-07-11T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-03","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":20709,"byte_start":19797,"line_end":520,"line_start":495},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-03/L495-L520","source_sha256":"90e6c1da841acdee1eef0abd3fae41bf0230f8aa6e549e738c988707c665503c","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十一、模特使用原则\r\n\r\n模特身上的商品会被顾客默认理解为门店当前推荐组合。\r\n\r\n因此，模特搭配不能只根据视觉效果决定。\r\n\r\n每组模特搭配至少要满足：\r\n\r\n商品在本店真实存在；\r\n商品当前允许销售；\r\n主要展示尺码具有基本可售能力；\r\n上下装和外层适用于相近场景；\r\n颜色和版型不存在尚未解决的问题。\r\n\r\n模特不能穿着暂停销售商品。\r\n\r\n总部样衣、员工私人商品和其他门店借来的商品，不能被当作本店现货陈列。\r\n\r\n当某组搭配的关键商品售罄时，门店应及时更换。不能因为换装麻烦，长期保留已经失去销售依据的展示。\r\n\r\n儿童模特的位置还要考虑安全。\r\n\r\n模特底座不能侵占主要通道，容易倾倒的装饰物不能放在儿童可触碰范围，挂绳和长带不能自然垂落在低处。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-03-012","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-03-014","fragment_sha256":"d0b695a4c2252b906d070ac48dcfc7ca34fb21b2e4cbf3ce115f5bcb6fe00fba","observed_at":"2026-07-11T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-03","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":22554,"byte_start":21563,"line_end":569,"line_start":545},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-03/L545-L569","source_sha256":"90e6c1da841acdee1eef0abd3fae41bf0230f8aa6e549e738c988707c665503c","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十三、陈列搭配依据\r\n\r\n笛语不允许仅因为颜色接近，就判断两件商品适合搭配。\r\n\r\n一组有效搭配需要同时考虑：\r\n\r\n穿着场景是否一致；\r\n厚度关系是否合理；\r\n版型叠加是否影响活动；\r\n尺码范围是否能够对应；\r\n门店是否有真实库存；\r\n顾客是否容易理解增减方式。\r\n\r\n例如，云感长袖上衣与轻薄外套可以构成温差叠穿，因为内外层厚度和活动关系相对合理。\r\n\r\n活动卫衣与软结构短夹克可以在视觉上搭配，但两件外层同时使用可能造成肩部和袖窿拥挤，不能仅根据配色形成推荐。\r\n\r\n灯芯绒衬衫夹克可以与基础上衣叠穿，但不适合放在100厘米小童区。\r\n\r\n轻正式连衣裙可以与针织开衫搭配，但存在拉链问题的浅灰绿连衣裙不能进入任何方案。\r\n\r\n一组搭配在总部层面成立，不代表每家门店都可以使用。门店仍需要满足现货和状态条件。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-03-014","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-03-015","fragment_sha256":"c472bffb69bd8c73bdb6edb5d032e1e5a31af472b71ba155e2996310447212f9","observed_at":"2026-07-11T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-03","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":23308,"byte_start":22554,"line_end":591,"line_start":570},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-03/L570-L591","source_sha256":"90e6c1da841acdee1eef0abd3fae41bf0230f8aa6e549e738c988707c665503c","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十四、陈列调整前后怎样记录\r\n\r\n笛语要求门店保留调整前后照片，但照片不能只用于证明“换陈完成”。\r\n\r\n调整记录应说明：\r\n\r\n为什么要调整；\r\n原来存在什么问题；\r\n移动了哪些商品；\r\n哪些商品因为缺货或暂停被撤下；\r\n调整后希望改善什么；\r\n现场是否出现新的问题；\r\n这个判断是否已经得到顾客行为支持。\r\n\r\n如果只是因为总部要求在某天换陈，也要如实说明，不能事后虚构顾客需求。\r\n\r\n陈列效果也不能只靠照片判断。\r\n\r\n照片可能显示画面整洁，但没有反映顾客是否容易拿取商品，是否频繁询问缺货款，儿童是否堵住通道，以及店员补货是否困难。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-03-015","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-03-018","fragment_sha256":"66824067ad468d9f039da75b5694ca84154b1f88a6c0cd69317ae996151e53fe","observed_at":"2026-07-11T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-03","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":26205,"byte_start":25403,"line_end":655,"line_start":634},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-03/L634-L655","source_sha256":"90e6c1da841acdee1eef0abd3fae41bf0230f8aa6e549e738c988707c665503c","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十七、陈列建议怎样避免编造\r\n\r\n系统可以根据空间和商品状态提出建议，例如：\r\n\r\n将缺货商品从入口主模特撤下；\r\n把温差叠穿商品放在相邻区域；\r\n扩大儿童容易拥堵位置的通道；\r\n让中大童专属商品远离小童区域；\r\n暂停商品同时撤下价格牌和内容物料。\r\n\r\n但这些建议不能自动变成门店已经执行的事实。\r\n\r\n系统提出“建议将中岛向内移动二十厘米”，不代表门店真的移动过。\r\n\r\n系统生成一张搭配示意，也不代表对应门店有货。\r\n\r\n系统推断“这组颜色更适合本店顾客”，更不能直接进入正式资料。\r\n\r\n只有门店完成调整、留下现场资料并由负责人确认后，才能成为后续可使用的陈列记录。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-03-018","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-04-013-S01","fragment_sha256":"deabfad3f3d03dc3d8ea5dba118638665dbcf77e90db701ab60ebc08be9c07e2","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-04","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":22886,"byte_start":22172,"line_end":633,"line_start":607},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-04/L607-L633","source_sha256":"1560ace1e15affb5a20e9a80df2b7184aa826af6811fe8a54eeca32f33eabe23","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"## 1. 云感长袖上衣领口调整\r\n\r\n第一版领口在120厘米和130厘米试穿中出现穿脱不顺畅。\r\n\r\n团队最初有两种意见：\r\n\r\n一种认为针织面料会在使用后自然放松，不需要修改；\r\n另一种认为首次穿脱体验已经说明存在问题。\r\n\r\n许闻川选择修改。\r\n\r\n版师没有简单放大整个领圈，而是调整横向宽度和前领深度，避免领口洗后过松。\r\n\r\n第二轮试穿中，穿脱顺畅度有所改善。\r\n\r\n目前能够确认的是：\r\n\r\n第二版比第一版更容易穿脱。\r\n\r\n不能确认的是：\r\n\r\n所有儿童都不会感到领口不适；\r\n长期洗涤后领口不会变形；\r\n它适合所有头围和穿着习惯。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-04-013","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-04-013-S02","fragment_sha256":"66dbbb34b63db8b14aec7a4a65f1e6715b9718a237cb7018d14e94d1065f060d","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-04","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":23305,"byte_start":22886,"line_end":649,"line_start":634},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-04/L634-L649","source_sha256":"1560ace1e15affb5a20e9a80df2b7184aa826af6811fe8a54eeca32f33eabe23","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"## 2. 活动卫衣后领摩擦处理\r\n\r\n首轮试穿中，一名儿童反映后领位置有摩擦感。\r\n\r\n团队检查后发现，主要问题来自缝份和包边处理。\r\n\r\n调整后增加柔软包条。\r\n\r\n第二次试穿中，没有再次出现相同反馈。\r\n\r\n但只有少量试穿不足以证明问题永久解决。\r\n\r\n商品可以说明工艺已经调整，不能宣传为“零摩擦领口”。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-04-013","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-04-013-S03","fragment_sha256":"0f725cbda8e125b25118b51d19828abd5bc9ea84dd495a357128269cfb973666","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-04","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":23785,"byte_start":23305,"line_end":667,"line_start":650},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-04/L650-L667","source_sha256":"1560ace1e15affb5a20e9a80df2b7184aa826af6811fe8a54eeca32f33eabe23","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"## 3. 活动长裤膝部结构取消\r\n\r\n第一版活动长裤为了增强视觉设计，在膝部加入较明显立体褶。\r\n\r\n静态站立时，结构清楚。\r\n\r\n儿童坐下和蹲下后，褶量在膝部堆积，部分试穿者会用手整理。\r\n\r\n许闻川决定减少褶量。\r\n\r\n设计人员最初担心修改后商品缺少辨识度。\r\n\r\n林知远认为，辨识度不能依靠持续打扰穿着者来建立。\r\n\r\n最终版本只保留较小的结构余量。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-04-013","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-04-013-S04","fragment_sha256":"a14e4013d67c20f4d786e14b621277c55323f643fd76caf640225965966b1290","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-04","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":24146,"byte_start":23785,"line_end":681,"line_start":668},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-04/L668-L681","source_sha256":"1560ace1e15affb5a20e9a80df2b7184aa826af6811fe8a54eeca32f33eabe23","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"## 4. 轻薄外套拉链头调整\r\n\r\n第一版使用较重的金属质感拉链头。\r\n\r\n儿童跑动时，拉链头会反复碰到胸前。\r\n\r\n团队改用更轻的软质拉片。\r\n\r\n这一变化没有形成强烈视觉卖点，但降低了明显晃动。\r\n\r\n内容可以讲述为什么放弃原设计，不能把修改描述成重大技术创新。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-04-013","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-04-013-S05","fragment_sha256":"b4d9e37b3cea93256609798181979c226bb8ffb8bd93425be53cb4019152a165","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-04","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":24543,"byte_start":24146,"line_end":695,"line_start":682},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-04/L682-L695","source_sha256":"1560ace1e15affb5a20e9a80df2b7184aa826af6811fe8a54eeca32f33eabe23","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"## 5. 双面马甲口袋统一\r\n\r\n首批样衣两面口袋深度不同。\r\n\r\n设计团队最初认为，双面造型不同，可以保留不同口袋结构。\r\n\r\n门店试穿后发现，儿童从不同一面穿着时，对口袋使用的感受差异明显。\r\n\r\n团队最终统一深度。\r\n\r\n这个修改说明双面穿不能只追求外观变化，还要保持基本使用一致性。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-04-013","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-04-013-S06","fragment_sha256":"806ba4f0762024f7ab1e5cd31ecbeec7d4fb272f0dfdd20de9f7341522411bd2","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-04","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":24957,"byte_start":24543,"line_end":707,"line_start":696},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-04/L696-L707","source_sha256":"1560ace1e15affb5a20e9a80df2b7184aa826af6811fe8a54eeca32f33eabe23","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"## 6. 灯芯绒夹克取消100厘米\r\n\r\n第一轮内部讨论希望尺码从100厘米开始，以扩大适用范围。\r\n\r\n试穿后，团队发现面料触感、门襟结构和整体重量对较小儿童不够友好。\r\n\r\n团队没有通过缩小尺寸直接生产100厘米，而是取消该尺码。\r\n\r\n这项决定会减少一部分销售机会，但降低了门店用大尺码勉强推荐的风险。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-04-013","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-04-013-S07","fragment_sha256":"1bbbce8e29e9ad6ab624d834339418073628a7b6a595f2b13e446ff0eb4a73ad","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-04","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":25318,"byte_start":24957,"line_end":721,"line_start":708},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-04/L708-L721","source_sha256":"1560ace1e15affb5a20e9a80df2b7184aa826af6811fe8a54eeca32f33eabe23","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"## 7. 连帽风衣取消外露抽绳\r\n\r\n设计初稿中，帽口带有装饰抽绳。\r\n\r\n安全评审中，团队认为儿童颈部附近的外露长绳存在不必要风险。\r\n\r\n最终取消抽绳。\r\n\r\n这不是因为发生过事故，而是预防性设计判断。\r\n\r\n内容不能编造成“曾有儿童被绳带挂住，因此紧急改版”。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-04-013","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-04-013-S08","fragment_sha256":"3d4e50cdee10478d63ed0ae5b6e87e27050ded46f687201eb6cc253dcef06a80","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-04","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":25768,"byte_start":25318,"line_end":733,"line_start":722},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-04/L722-L733","source_sha256":"1560ace1e15affb5a20e9a80df2b7184aa826af6811fe8a54eeca32f33eabe23","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"## 8. 软结构短夹克放弃成人西装表达\r\n\r\n短夹克最初被内容团队称为“孩子人生中的第一件西装”。\r\n\r\n商品团队认为，它没有成人西装的结构，也不希望儿童承担对应的仪式想象。\r\n\r\n最终名称和内容回到实际商品：整洁、柔软、有一定结构感的短夹克。\r\n\r\n这一决定不是否定家庭仪式，而是不由品牌预先规定一件衣服必须代表什么。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-04-013","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-04-019","fragment_sha256":"d324116a26a45291802247daf453bfc06e36f9e5acb3b4abfbed0011a23d3df3","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-04","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":33847,"byte_start":32629,"line_end":979,"line_start":951},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-04/L951-L979","source_sha256":"1560ace1e15affb5a20e9a80df2b7184aa826af6811fe8a54eeca32f33eabe23","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十八、第四批结论\r\n\r\n本批建立了品牌每天真实运行时产生的四类资料：\r\n\r\n门店和总部每天发生的工作；\r\n顾客提出的具体问题；\r\n商品研发中的验证和放弃；\r\n经营中主动承担的代价和尚未兑现的承诺。\r\n\r\n这些资料共同说明：\r\n\r\n真实经营不是一连串完成事件，而是大量正在处理的状态。\r\n\r\n有些问题已经解决；\r\n有些只完成了第一步；\r\n有些暂时没有答案；\r\n有些正确选择没有带来成交；\r\n有些克制表达甚至减少了内容和销售机会。\r\n\r\n这些不完整并不是资料缺陷。\r\n\r\n它们恰恰构成了后续内容生产最重要的真实性基础。\r\n\r\n系统可以帮助企业组织这些经历，但不能替企业创造经历；\r\n可以帮助人物表达判断，但不能替人物编写人生；\r\n可以根据已有证据提出可能性，但不能把可能性改写成事实；\r\n可以记录承诺，但不能在实际完成以前宣布兑现。\r\n\r\n后续所有人物内容、门店日常、服务案例、研发故事和经营复盘，都必须从这些真实过程出发，而不是先决定要讲一个怎样的好故事，再回头寻找能够配合故事的材料。\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-04-019","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-05-002","fragment_sha256":"6b13b0debdedcbafbb7f3a9a327c389bc8b548550718ba49f9ca310c3eb8292c","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-05","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":1751,"byte_start":521,"line_end":42,"line_start":12},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-05/L12-L42","source_sha256":"8f53d4d510a754ba34ebbc21d86b539874fc180005e28baedb8ff6b62aa99b0e","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 一、笛语为什么把素材治理单独处理\r\n\r\n笛语早期曾把“有文件”和“可以使用”理解成同一件事。\r\n\r\n一张照片只要存在工作群里，就可能被内容人员保存；\r\n一段视频只要是门店员工拍摄，就容易被认为属于品牌；\r\n一个顾客主动说过好评，就容易被写进文案；\r\n一个员工同意出镜一次，就容易被长期当作账号人物使用。\r\n\r\n后来团队逐渐发现，文件存在只说明它曾经被记录，不说明品牌拥有无限使用权。\r\n\r\n顾谨言在内部培训中反复强调：\r\n\r\n> 素材不是因为进入企业系统，就自动失去它原来的主人、时间和边界。\r\n\r\n笛语因此把每一份图片、视频和文件分成三个问题处理：\r\n\r\n这份材料是否真实；\r\n这份材料是否适合当前内容；\r\n这份材料是否有权被当前账号使用。\r\n\r\n三个问题缺一不可。\r\n\r\n一张真实的顾客照片，没有公开授权，仍然不能使用。\r\n\r\n一段有授权的视频，如果商品状态已经变化，也不能继续当作当前现货证明。\r\n\r\n一份完整的商品检测文件，如果不允许公开原文，也只能用于内部确认，不能直接展示。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-05-002","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-05-003","fragment_sha256":"da4ceade0637e0353e642af8ae18a260bdf73f85e9b640d586c5f9a169a949f0","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-05","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":2645,"byte_start":1751,"line_end":70,"line_start":43},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-05/L43-L70","source_sha256":"8f53d4d510a754ba34ebbc21d86b539874fc180005e28baedb8ff6b62aa99b0e","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 二、素材不是越多越好\r\n\r\n唐予安最初希望门店“多拍、多存、以后总能用上”。\r\n\r\n顾谨言认为这种做法风险很大。\r\n\r\n没有主题和说明的素材，过一段时间后往往无法判断：\r\n\r\n是谁拍的；\r\n拍的是哪家门店；\r\n画面中的人是谁；\r\n商品当时是否可售；\r\n是否经过同意；\r\n是原始文件还是二次剪辑；\r\n是否还能继续使用。\r\n\r\n笛语后来不再鼓励无目的囤积素材。\r\n\r\n门店可以记录日常，但拍摄前需要知道为什么拍、拍到谁、准备在哪里使用。\r\n\r\n对没有明确用途、没有来源说明、无法识别人物授权状态的历史文件，品牌宁愿暂时不用，也不通过猜测补齐。\r\n\r\n林知远对此的判断是：\r\n\r\n> 不知道一份素材从哪里来，最合理的处理不是给它补一个故事，而是承认我们不知道。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-05-003","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-05-011","fragment_sha256":"4bfe093dc674db1ec9c65789a677858ccef1dcf3d3f04fce23f06ec2eb1e1c9c","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-05","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":22782,"byte_start":21786,"line_end":713,"line_start":678},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-05/L678-L713","source_sha256":"8f53d4d510a754ba34ebbc21d86b539874fc180005e28baedb8ff6b62aa99b0e","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十、图片和视频的编辑边界\r\n\r\n## 1. 可以做的处理\r\n\r\n在不改变事实的前提下，可以进行：\r\n\r\n裁剪无关背景；\r\n调整基础亮度；\r\n隐藏联系方式；\r\n对未授权人物做不可逆识别处理；\r\n删除空白等待部分；\r\n添加时间、地点和商品状态说明；\r\n将长视频剪成较短片段。\r\n\r\n这些处理仍然需要保留原始文件。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 2. 不能做的处理\r\n\r\n不能把不同日期的画面拼成同一次事件。\r\n\r\n不能把总部商品图和门店现场拼接后，制造本店到货画面。\r\n\r\n不能删除问题商品画面中的关键信息，让处理结果看起来更完整。\r\n\r\n不能通过配音改变人物原意。\r\n\r\n不能把一个员工的经历交给另一个员工重新表演，再写成真实记录。\r\n\r\n不能使用AI生成的门店、顾客、人物或商品画面冒充真实素材。\r\n\r\nAI可以生成陈列示意图和拍摄方案，但必须明确是示意，不是现场证据。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-05-011","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-05-013","fragment_sha256":"dcf9bd3f219e8095f53df58e145765ca23f7a9f85f5d6b2847236671702adb3f","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-05","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":25024,"byte_start":24318,"line_end":791,"line_start":770},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-05/L770-L791","source_sha256":"8f53d4d510a754ba34ebbc21d86b539874fc180005e28baedb8ff6b62aa99b0e","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十二、授权期限和撤回\r\n\r\n笛语不使用“一次授权永久有效”的默认方式。\r\n\r\n人物授权应说明使用账号、内容类型和大致期限。\r\n\r\n部分长期岗位人物可以提供较长时间授权，但仍保留撤回权。\r\n\r\n顾客和儿童素材原则上采用单次或单主题授权。\r\n\r\n授权到期后，未发布内容停止使用。\r\n\r\n已经发布的内容需要根据授权约定判断是否删除、隐藏或停止再次传播。\r\n\r\n撤回不一定意味着品牌过去使用违法或错误。\r\n\r\n一个人可以因为离职、家庭变化、个人感受或不愿继续公开而撤回。\r\n\r\n品牌不要求当事人提供足够“合理”的理由。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-05-013","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-05-015","fragment_sha256":"ebb6358a2edbe0467ae1ca96ae1323e64e2d7531989837749812191833ed23a5","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-05","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":26677,"byte_start":25963,"line_end":837,"line_start":818},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-05/L818-L837","source_sha256":"8f53d4d510a754ba34ebbc21d86b539874fc180005e28baedb8ff6b62aa99b0e","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十四、离职人员素材怎样处理\r\n\r\n一名员工离职，不代表所有历史内容都必须删除，也不代表品牌可以永久继续使用。\r\n\r\n需要根据原授权判断：\r\n\r\n内容是否已经公开；\r\n授权是否包含离职后继续使用；\r\n是否涉及持续代言或账号人物身份；\r\n员工是否提出撤回；\r\n继续传播是否会让公众误以为其仍在职。\r\n\r\n例如，早期团队合影可以作为历史资料保留，但不能继续用于“现有团队介绍”。\r\n\r\n离职员工过去拍摄的商品操作视频，如果只展示手部且授权允许继续使用，可以保留。\r\n\r\n如果视频高度依赖个人身份和经历，则应重新评估。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-05-015","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-05-016","fragment_sha256":"7c74a0d82f469718bc22122d85afa7cf7e99446043059b063aad4242e59ddfe4","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-05","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":27200,"byte_start":26677,"line_end":853,"line_start":838},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-05/L838-L853","source_sha256":"8f53d4d510a754ba34ebbc21d86b539874fc180005e28baedb8ff6b62aa99b0e","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十五、文件原件与内容引用\r\n\r\n笛语要求保留原始文件，不用剪辑版本替代原件。\r\n\r\n原始文件用于确认时间、画面完整性和编辑过程。\r\n\r\n公开内容可以引用文件，但不能让引用版本反过来成为唯一证据。\r\n\r\n例如，一条短视频引用了商品改版过程。\r\n\r\n后续不能只根据这条短视频证明商品确实改版，还需要回到样衣记录、评审说明和相关图片。\r\n\r\n内容是资料的表达结果，不是资料本身。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-05-016","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-05-017","fragment_sha256":"8664a509dd081d99626582bd7b1fa1ce3d53f704ab74747e061f3c198f3b52ba","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-05","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":27755,"byte_start":27200,"line_end":873,"line_start":854},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-05/L854-L873","source_sha256":"8f53d4d510a754ba34ebbc21d86b539874fc180005e28baedb8ff6b62aa99b0e","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十六、历史素材清查\r\n\r\n截至7月12日，总部正在清查早期历史素材。\r\n\r\n目前发现三类问题：\r\n\r\n部分照片没有记录拍摄者；\r\n部分员工出镜只有口头同意；\r\n部分门店素材已经公开，但没有说明允许哪些账号继续使用。\r\n\r\n这些文件暂时不能进入新的内容生产。\r\n\r\n已经发布的历史内容不立即全部删除。\r\n\r\n团队需要逐条判断人物身份、授权状态、当前影响和是否仍在传播。\r\n\r\n品牌不能声称历史素材已经全部合规。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-05-017","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-05-023","fragment_sha256":"4109a2f1d0d86cb2538a8b533b42b10bb8ee41bc5ccc4b9cf53c7866ebda01fb","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-05","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":32559,"byte_start":31418,"line_end":1021,"line_start":994},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-05/L994-L1021","source_sha256":"8f53d4d510a754ba34ebbc21d86b539874fc180005e28baedb8ff6b62aa99b0e","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 二十二、第五批结论\r\n\r\n本批建立的是笛语品牌世界中的素材与权利边界。\r\n\r\n一份素材能否使用，不只取决于它拍得好不好，也不只取决于它是不是真实。\r\n\r\n它还取决于：\r\n\r\n谁拍摄；\r\n谁出现在其中；\r\n当时为什么拍；\r\n原本允许什么用途；\r\n哪个账号准备使用；\r\n商品和事件状态是否仍然有效；\r\n授权是否到期或撤回；\r\n编辑以后是否改变了原意。\r\n\r\n笛语不认为授权治理会削弱内容能力。\r\n\r\n相反，清晰的授权边界能够让总部、区域和门店知道哪些内容可以放心使用，哪些需要补充确认，哪些必须停止。\r\n\r\n系统不能把“文件存在”解释成“品牌拥有”；\r\n不能把“人物同意一次”解释成“永久授权”；\r\n不能把“已经匿名”解释成“必然无法识别”；\r\n不能把“真实发生”解释成“适合公开”；\r\n不能把“允许内部使用”解释成“允许所有账号发布”。\r\n\r\n当授权不足时，系统的责任不是替品牌找到一个绕开的方法，而是明确指出缺少什么，并停止使用。\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-05-023","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-06-002","fragment_sha256":"4504bdc536c97d4531063b3e26f1dbcab977337cf4893abce947e5eed992ff4f","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-06","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":1516,"byte_start":536,"line_end":38,"line_start":12},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-06/L12-L38","source_sha256":"698a1636493f46d80ed91c5957b0f07ea4e901928b8321152a85ab2a153d7172","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 一、为什么发布记录不能只保存最终文案\r\n\r\n笛语最初保存内容时，只保留已经发出的标题、正文和视频。\r\n\r\n这种做法很快暴露出问题。\r\n\r\n一条内容过了一段时间后，团队只能看到它说了什么，却不知道：\r\n\r\n为什么当时选择这个题材；\r\n用了哪些真实资料；\r\n哪些句子在审核中被删除；\r\n由谁确认商品和门店状态；\r\n发布时哪些信息有效；\r\n内容后来是否因为库存、授权或人员变化停止使用；\r\n顾客反馈针对的是商品、人物、价格，还是表达方式；\r\n这条内容是否已经被其他账号反复改写。\r\n\r\n唐予安认为，如果只保存最终内容，团队很容易把表现好的结果神化，却忘记内容成立所依赖的真实条件。\r\n\r\n她要求每条已发布内容都能够回到三个问题：\r\n\r\n这条内容为什么可以发；\r\n它实际产生了什么反馈；\r\n它现在还能不能继续使用。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-06-002","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-06-017","fragment_sha256":"f39809d91f954af783a579aa117dd4310245ff6169ada6aea6ca4ed6d4193dca","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-06","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":23212,"byte_start":22331,"line_end":801,"line_start":772},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-06/L772-L801","source_sha256":"698a1636493f46d80ed91c5957b0f07ea4e901928b8321152a85ab2a153d7172","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十六、内容反馈怎样被理解\r\n\r\n笛语不把点赞、评论、收藏和咨询直接等同于内容有效。\r\n\r\n一条内容互动高，可能因为：\r\n\r\n标题有冲突；\r\n人物表达真实；\r\n商品问题容易引发讨论；\r\n用户持有相反意见；\r\n平台临时增加推荐；\r\n内容触及从业者而非目标顾客。\r\n\r\n一条内容带来咨询，也不代表带来合适顾客。\r\n\r\n例如，滨江店陈列内容带来了浅卡其风衣库存询问，但该尺码已经接近缺货。\r\n\r\n如果只看咨询数量，内容表现不错；如果看门店实际承接能力，它也增加了重复解释。\r\n\r\n因此，反馈至少需要区分：\r\n\r\n用户是否理解内容；\r\n是否提出新的事实问题；\r\n是否产生到店或商品咨询；\r\n门店是否能够承接；\r\n内容是否引发误解；\r\n是否值得继续同题材创作。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-06-017","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-06-018","fragment_sha256":"358fb5237c356eabc37b2392efff9fff7b1143ea7bea3a310162d5ca79d1534c","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-06","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":23923,"byte_start":23212,"line_end":821,"line_start":802},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-06/L802-L821","source_sha256":"698a1636493f46d80ed91c5957b0f07ea4e901928b8321152a85ab2a153d7172","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 十七、不能从反馈中自动得出的结论\r\n\r\n收藏较多，不能自动说明用户认可品牌价值观。\r\n\r\n评论较多，不能自动说明内容具有购买转化能力。\r\n\r\n顾客询问商品，不能自动说明商品受欢迎。\r\n\r\n一位用户表达认同，不能自动成为顾客证言。\r\n\r\n门店内容传播较好，不能自动说明该店经营优秀。\r\n\r\n创始人观点获得支持，不能自动成为品牌事实。\r\n\r\n同一问题在评论区多次出现，也需要区分是否来自不同用户、是否受到内容引导，以及问题本身是否真实存在。\r\n\r\n系统可以整理反馈主题，但不能自动把反馈总结成“消费者普遍认为”。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-06-018","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-06-021","fragment_sha256":"4c48a5e2173fb0506d714c97267eea0ad11ed7bfbe7d9f976249f0cf9e579546","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-06","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":26629,"byte_start":25631,"line_end":913,"line_start":875},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-06/L875-L913","source_sha256":"698a1636493f46d80ed91c5957b0f07ea4e901928b8321152a85ab2a153d7172","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 二十、账号之间的内容连续性\r\n\r\n## 总部官方账号\r\n\r\n应该持续建立：\r\n\r\n品牌事实边界；\r\n商品正式信息；\r\n跨部门经营判断；\r\n经过批准的品牌故事。\r\n\r\n不宜高频发布单店日常，否则会与门店账号争夺身份。\r\n\r\n## 创始人账号\r\n\r\n应该围绕真实经营判断、产品选择和长期问题展开。\r\n\r\n不能每次都从具体门店错误中提炼创始人观点，否则创始人会变成所有事件的最终解释者。\r\n\r\n## 产品实验室账号\r\n\r\n应该持续记录商品如何形成、验证、放弃和调整。\r\n\r\n不能只讲成功改版，也要保留尚未解决和没有明显结果的测试。\r\n\r\n## 区域账号\r\n\r\n应该讲区域共同问题、跨店协作和当地经营差异。\r\n\r\n不能把区域账号变成门店内容汇总转发页。\r\n\r\n## 门店账号\r\n\r\n应该以本店真实商品、人物、服务、陈列和本地生活为核心。\r\n\r\n不能长期依赖总部白底图和统一话术。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-06-021","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-06-024","fragment_sha256":"98a48f5d9c3bd343c81294890b69ac141d51c60d2ee2453cecf5588187044f2e","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-06","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":32618,"byte_start":31696,"line_end":1139,"line_start":1112},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-06/L1112-L1139","source_sha256":"698a1636493f46d80ed91c5957b0f07ea4e901928b8321152a85ab2a153d7172","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 二十三、当前最明显的资料缺口\r\n\r\n第一，缺少连续三十天以上的门店日常记录。\r\n\r\n现有事件能够支持单条内容，但还不足以形成账号长期叙事。\r\n\r\n第二，缺少真实天气、节日、学校活动和社区生活资料。\r\n\r\n本地生活内容目前仍然停留在门店内部。\r\n\r\n第三，缺少商品长期穿着、洗涤、退换和复购资料。\r\n\r\n目前大部分商品内容来自研发和早期销售阶段。\r\n\r\n第四，缺少顾客明确同意公开的完整案例。\r\n\r\n现有顾客资料更适合匿名答疑和内部培训。\r\n\r\n第五，缺少内容发布后的真实经营关联。\r\n\r\n当前只能看到互动和咨询，无法确认是否形成到店、试穿、成交、退货或长期信任。\r\n\r\n第六，缺少不同账号使用同一事实后的对比结果。\r\n\r\n目前还不能判断哪种身份和表达方式最适合某类题材。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-06-024","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"applicable_organization_ids":["ORG-DIYU-HQ"],"applicable_store_ids":[null],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","data_version_digest":"391ba3397855bbb3f97c0ac66c28d46c12ceb37aaee901d94907ddaeec22a69a","derivation_review_state":"PACKAGE5_EVIDENCE_CLOSED","disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","fragment_id":"PKG5-FRAGMENT-BD-NARR-06-027","fragment_sha256":"a3fce5e9f7afcf3de23f12a1610921d36c3cff7571f716be3b2d0600fe948d9f","observed_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","package6_adapter_eligible":true,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"simulation_only":true,"source_id":"SOURCE-06","source_organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","source_position":{"byte_end_exclusive":35731,"byte_start":34444,"line_end":1251,"line_start":1208},"source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-06/L1208-L1251","source_sha256":"698a1636493f46d80ed91c5957b0f07ea4e901928b8321152a85ab2a153d7172","source_store_id":null,"source_time_precision":"DATE_ONLY_NO_TIMEZONE_NORMALIZED_TO_UTC_DAY_START","status":"ACTIVE","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","text":"# 二十六、第六批结论\r\n\r\n本批建立的不是一份内容成绩单，而是一套内容运行记录。\r\n\r\n它让品牌能够知道：\r\n\r\n哪些内容已经发布；\r\n为什么当时可以发布；\r\n审核删除了哪些过度表达；\r\n用户实际提出了什么问题；\r\n哪些反馈不能被过度解释；\r\n哪些事件已经被使用过；\r\n哪些账号不应该继续重复；\r\n哪些能力资料充足；\r\n哪些题材仍然缺少真实生活基础。\r\n\r\n目前笛语最强的内容基础，是：\r\n\r\n商品研发；\r\n事实边界；\r\n门店经营；\r\n陈列调整；\r\n服务复盘。\r\n\r\n最弱的内容基础，是：\r\n\r\n长期顾客关系；\r\n本地城市生活；\r\n商品长期使用；\r\n普通员工的连续成长；\r\n发布内容与真实经营结果之间的关联。\r\n\r\n这意味着系统不应该继续大量生成“我们为什么坚持真实”一类价值观内容。\r\n\r\n下一阶段更重要的是补充新的现实，而不是继续改写同一套判断。\r\n\r\n内容数据库的价值，不是让品牌永远有话可说。\r\n\r\n它应该帮助品牌分清：\r\n\r\n什么时候已经有新的事实；\r\n什么时候只是换了一种说法；\r\n什么时候可以继续讲；\r\n什么时候应该停止重复，回到真实经营中等待新的事情发生。\r\n","unit_id":"BD-NARR-06-027","valid_until":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"}
